    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Sit where the musicians sit… onstage! Concertmaster Lillian Scheirich, along with the WSO, brings to life the works of Wijeratne, Boccherini, and José Evangelista, showcasing a diverse range of styles and emotions. From Wijeratne’s A Letter from the After-life, inspired by a quatrain from The Rubáiyát of Omar Khayyám, to the joy of Boccherini, and..."
