      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Windsor Symphony Community Orchestra Ancient Treasures: Indiana Jones and Mulan Join the Windsor Symphony Community Orchestra on an epic musical adventure through the ancient world. Iconic film scores by John Williams and Miklós Rózsa, together with hit songs from the musical Mulan, join a program of masterpieces by Debussy, Borodin, and Respighi that evoke the..."
