        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Windsor Symphony Youth Orchestra Revolutionaries The talented students of the Windsor Symphony Youth Orchestras perform the music of boundary-breaking composers in their final concert of the season. From two of Beethoven’s most famous symphonic works to hits from the world of musical theatre and rock and roll, this program explores the music of history’s social..."
