    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Heartwarming and hilarious, two of Canadian author Robert Munsch’s favourite children’s books take center stage: Thomas’ Snowsuit and The Paper Bag Princess, accompanied by the musicians of the WSO. Geoffrey Larson, conductor Jan Radford, co-host 10:00am & 11:30am. This concert is 45 minutes. General admission. Adults $10  /  Children $5 Guarantee a seat by purchasing a Family Concert Package..."
      }
