        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Beauty and the Beat"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Canadian composer Jordan Pal’s edgy Upwell – described as the natural process that lifts nutrient-rich waters to the surface and fuels new life and growth. Upwell was written for a digital performer and orchestra. It brings together new technology and traditional music. This concert also features Ralph Vaughan Williams’ Symphony No. 8 – a powerful..."
      }
