    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Abridged Opera and the Windsor Symphony Orchestra present Johann Strauss II’s Fledermaus: A Champagne Masquerade Abridged Opera partners up again with the Windsor Symphony Orchestra to bring to life Johann Strauss II’s Viennese comedy, “Fledermaus: A Champagne Masquerade.” Fledermaus is a sparkling confection of mistaken identities, illicit liaisons, and champagne-fueled merriment. The actress Rosalinda and her husband Eisenstein..."
