    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The WSO shares the stage with symphonic rock collective Jeans n’ Classics for an evening of music by two of rock’s most iconic bands: Led Zeppelin and The Who. This concert features hits like The Who’s My Generation and Baba O’Riley and Led Zeppelin’s Dazed & Confused and Stairway to Heaven. Geoffrey Larson, conductor Jeans n’..."
