    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Midwinter Musical Feast 2026 The WSO’s coziest tradition is back! Warm up with the WSO and come for a delicious meal, music and friendship. Monday, February 2, 2026 Nico Walkerville (325 Devonshire Rd., Windsor) Doors open 6:30pm Dinner and music 7:00pm Dinner Options: PICANHA – Slow cooked beef roast/ red wine-beef jus POLLO INVOLTINI –..."
      }
