    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Sit where the musicians sit… onstage! Take a musical journey with the greats: Mozart, Copland, and D’Indy. This concert highlights the unique voices of each composer and their impact on the world of music. Featuring the WSO’s Faith Scholfield, English horn, and Ross Turner, trumpet. Yi-Ping Chen, guest conductor Faith Scholfield, English horn Ross Turner,...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
