        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Johann Strauss II&#8217;s Fledermaus: A Champagne Masquerade"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Abridged Opera and the Windsor Symphony Orchestra present Johann Strauss II\\'s Fledermaus: A Champagne Masquerade Abridged Opera partners up again with the Windsor Symphony Orchestra to bring to life Johann Strauss II\\'s Viennese comedy, &quot;Fledermaus: A Champagne Masquerade.&quot; Fledermaus is a sparkling confection of mistaken identities, illicit liaisons, and champagne-fueled merriment. The actress Rosalinda and her husband Eisenstein...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
